  "req_0001_finding": {
    "question": "Authoritative definition/parent of Gujarat municipal code 23306 = 'Penalty Recovered from Contractors'.",
    "nmam_answer": "The 5-digit code 23306 does NOT exist in NMAM (0 occurrences in the manual text; NMAM income codes are 3-level 110-180, not 5-digit). NMAM's authoritative home for penalty-type revenue income is minor head 140-20 'Penalties and Fines' (under major head 140 'Fees & User Charges'). Contractor/supplier-specific recoveries appear in NMAM only as illustrative remarks under 180-11 'Lapsed Deposits' (remark: 'Contractors, Suppliers') and 180-10 'Deposits Forfeited'. Therefore 23306 is a Gujarat state-specific detailed head, not a national NMAM code. Its nearest NMAM parent concept is 140-20 Penalties and Fines.",
    "confidence": "NMAM side verified this turn from the acquired manual. The de-jure Gujarat manual that would formally define 23306's parent head was NOT locatable online (see references/gmam/README.md). 23306's name is confirmed de-facto from AMC budget books (references/gmam/)."
  },
