    {"code": "140-20", "head_name": "Penalties and Fines", "parent_code": "140", "major_head": "140", "function_group": null, "income_or_expense": "income", "accrual_basis": true, "source": "NMAM 2004 Appendix 2 (Income)", "page": "4.19", "notes": "REQ-0001 KEY HEAD. This is NMAM's authoritative home for penalty/fine revenue income. Illustrative remark in manual: 'Octroi, Cess'. Gujarat's 233 penalty group (23305 Penalty from Suppliers, 23306 Penalty from Contractors, 23320 Fine to Employee) maps conceptually here. Also cross-referenced elsewhere in NMAM as account 140-20-(a) 'Penalties and Fines' (Chapter 6, para 6.14 and worked entries). NMAM contains NO 5-digit code and NO 'Penalty Recovered from Contractors' detailed head; contractor-specificity is a Gujarat state addition."},
